{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you found a lost little QPet. You feed her and play with her, and she soon makes herself at home on your screen. She works, plays, and dances to music\u2014and even brings friends, turning your desktop into a lively, warm, and heartwarming little world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free desktop pet, cutely stays in the taskbar without interrupting your work or study.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, lively animations bring your QPet to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dances automatically to your music, with lots of dance animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support mouse interaction effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support import Chibi MMD models.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on multiple monitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support Multi-language interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and optimized\u2014runs smoothly even on low-end PCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with other games, apps, and live wallpapers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[NOTE]: QPet's buildin default character avatar \u201cKipfel\u201d  with permission from Mochiyama Kingyo. \u00a9Mochiyama Kingyo </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1093890?t=1763125659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1093890/c4c5587dd1c6ec7ec6b1f0f47384a7eac411ec26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763125659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1093890/2aa1e444fe205bfa298a8e4062e6eef790658ad4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763125659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1093890/2aa1e444fe205bfa298a8e4062e6eef790658ad4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17631